        "raw": "<p>&nbsp;Hey first time posting and tried finding this answer.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; Now if I got this right....</p><p>&nbsp;You cannot activate the same power unless you can activate 2 powers in 1 turn... and its not limited?</p><p>&nbsp;Last night during our game with akatubusha (sp) she had multiple limb in play...</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; a) the ones that did H-2 hp to all ( would they each happen or since its the same effect only 1)</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; b) the ones that reduce damage to her (sorry this in 2 parts... * is all her limbs and cards considered her</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; * will each of these reduces stack )</p><p>&nbsp;So again tried looking for these instances and hope you can decifer my ramblings....lol</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; Any info and help would be appreciated.</p>",
